-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ScaleQ-1.58, CAT-Q and BitTern (references)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

research/papers/2608.01078.pdf is the unmodified ScaleQ-1.58 paper (Shigeng
Wang, Chao Li, Yangyuxuan Kang, Jiawei Fan, Anbang Yao; arXiv:2608.01078). It
keeps its original copyright and license terms and is not covered by
Apache-2.0. See research/papers/README.md.

The CAT-Q code under research/catq/ and the AYOT trace generation in
openbonsai/stages/traces.py are independent implementations informed by that paper
and by the BitTern CAT-Q release (IntelChina-AI/BitTern, commit
5a8fcd4f7e0366554b732d300a37e6ea467c3c35, projects/cat-q). No BitTern source
files are included.

